cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MapVerity in research or a publication, please cite it as below."
title: "MapVerity: field-level assurance for data pipelines"
abstract: >-
  Open-source framework for mapping-driven source-to-target validation of data pipelines, data
  mutation testing, explainable defect-risk prediction and risk-adaptive test prioritization
  (ERAD-QA) with deterministic quality gates.
authors:
